        message_SetFace(ACTOR_NPC_PERIPPAA1, FACE_NORMAL, FACE_POS_STANDARD);
        message_Talk({
            english="""
                 Greetings![K] Welcome to [CS:P]Pelipper
                Island[CR].
            """,
        });
        message_Talk({
            english="""
                 This is where you can spend
                time until you have been rescued.
            """,
        });
        message_Talk({
            english="""
                 You may go explore dungeons
                that you have visited before.
            """,
        });
        message_Talk({
            english="""
                 It's an ideal way to spend some
                time while you wait for rescue.
            """,
        });
        message_Talk({
            english="""
                 However, if your team were to
                be defeated here, you may not send out for
                a rescue.
            """,
        });
        message_Talk({
            english="""
                 And when you exit the dungeon
                and return here to the island, your level and
                moves will be set back to what they were.
            """,
        });
        message_Talk({
            english="""
                 You also can't recruit new
                members to your team.
            """,
        });
        message_Talk({
            english="""
                 What can you do? Well, you get
                to keep all the money and items you find!
            """,
        });
        message_Talk({
            english="""
                 But the items and money must
                be put in storage here before you leave if
                you want to take them out in Treasure Town.
            """,
        });
